<title>USA: G-III Apparel names president.</title>
<headline>G-III Apparel names president.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>G-III Apparel Group said on Monday that it has named Jeanette Nostra-Katz as president of the company.</p>
<p>Nostra-Katz, who has been with the company for more than 15 years, assumes the title previously held by Morris Goldfarb, who will remain as chief executive officer, the company said.</p>
